\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Validation restoration accuracy vs.\ epoch on the restoration dataset ($N=20$, $k=4$, $D=10^6$). In this saved run, the 1F model has low accuracy while the 2F model passes through an intermediate plateau around 0.54 before improving sharply towards near-perfect accuracy. The transition suggests a learning bottleneck that training eventually overcomes; it is distinct from the representational lower bound. Values use the saved batch-mean metric.}}{27}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:valacc-H20k4}{{5}{27}{Validation restoration accuracy vs.\ epoch on the restoration dataset ($N=20$, $k=4$, $D=10^6$). In this saved run, the 1F model has low accuracy while the 2F model passes through an intermediate plateau around 0.54 before improving sharply towards near-perfect accuracy. The transition suggests a learning bottleneck that training eventually overcomes; it is distinct from the representational lower bound. Values use the saved batch-mean metric}{figure.5}{}}
